# pan-twitch-release (h2-input): a drag, a 500 ms rest, a 1 px twitch, release.
# The plane follows the twitch (center -4.04) and stops: the twitch's speed
# over the flick window is ~zero, so no glide. Behaviour as pan-release-still.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 728 490
down
move 928 490 over 128
wait 500
move 929 490
up
wait 1000
shot pan-twitch-release
